        "Content": "A SIMPLY SUPERB 1 BED / 1 BATH FIRST FLOOR APARTMENT WITH DESIGNATED CAR SPACE AND PRIVATE BALCONY IDEALLY SITUATED IN THE HIGHLY SOUGHT AFTER BEACON APARTMENT COMPLEX IN ROYAL CANAL PARK ASHTOWN DUBLIN 15\r\n\r\nEARLY VIEWING IS STRONGLY RECOMMENDED….\r\n\r\nMulti Award Winning Team Christina Wilson The Dublin 15 Property Specialists are delighted to present No.8 Beacon to the Ashtown property market. Beacon in Royal Canal Park is a popular private well maintained development of superior family homes tucked away in a secluded position. Every conceivable amenity is literally on your doorstep.\r\n\r\nAn excellent investment by any standards this superior apartment will make an ideal home. No expense has been spared on the finish of this property. No. 8 will no doubt appeal to first time buyers and investors alike. This beautiful property has been tastefully decorated to a premium standard throughout and is in immaculate walk in condition. This modern apartment features top quality flooring, fixtures and fittings. To include all integrated kitchen appliances.\r\n\r\nThe floor plan briefly consists of: An entrance hallway leading to a bright and airy living room area with modern kitchen / dining area boasting top quality crisp white designer units and matching countertop. The kitchen has an abundance of both worktop and storage space. The bathroom features top quality sanitary ware. The spacious double bedroom has fitted wardrobes. Also there is a separate utility room off the hallway. This fine apartment has an intercom, quality glazing throughout and a top grade heating system.\r\n\r\nThe location is second to none within a 12 minute drive of Dublin International Airport. Dublin City Centre is only circa 7km. Royal Canal Park is very well serviced by public transport including Dublin Bus, Pelletstown & Ashtown Train stations and the LUAS terminal at Broombridge are both within a short walk, ensuring easy access to the City Centre and beyond. In addition the N2/N3 and M50 motorways are also close to hand making this a strategical positioned address. Ashtown Village with its superb wide variety of shops and restaurants is within a short stroll of the property. The well known Castleknock and Phibsborough Villages are both within close proximity whilst Blanchardstown Village and The Blanchardstown Shopping Centre are also located nearby. D.15's Corporate Parks and Connolly Hospital are also close by. The Phoenix Park is within a 5 minute drive. Please see list of other amenities below…\r\n\r\nGreen space:-\r\nThe Royal Canal is situated on your doorstep only a four minute walk away. Added to this there is Tolka Valley Park, Ashington park, Crescent park, GAA club training fields. You can actually walk along the canal all the way into Phibsboro, Glasnevin, Drumcondra, Northstrand, Croke park and into the Docklands (Spencer Dock).\r\n\r\nLocal Sports clubs:-\r\nCoolmine rugby club, St. Oliver Plunkett Eoghan Ruadh GAA Club Phoenix football club and Elm Green Golf Club. Royal Canal Kayak Club is only a four minute walk away.\r\n\r\nPub/ restaurants:-\r\nThe Lock keeper, Geisha restaurant, The famous Halfway House pub is nearby, The iconic Hole In The Wall pub is next door to the Phoenix Park.\r\n\r\nCafes:-\r\nDouglas and Kaldi cafe, Marmalade cafe, Cafe Dubai, Tinbox coffe, DASH coffee container all within a very short walking distance\r\n\r\nGyms:-\r\nSpace Gym at 8th lock, Inspire Fitness Centre Cabra, Revolution Fitness Cabra, MBC Fitness and Kilo Training are all within very short walking distance.\r\n\r\nFacilities:-\r\nHairdressers, Barbers, Beautician, Dentist, 2x Medical centres, Dry cleaners, 2x Children's playgrounds, Creches, Veterinary clinic etc are all located in the complex.\r\n\r\nSupermarkets:-\r\nSuperValu, Aldi, Centra, Spar all in the locality.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is highly advised…\r\n\r\n**Service Charge/Management Fee €1,576 per annum.**\r\n\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
